+# Approved pilot
+
+User, 2026-10-31: “훨씬 낫네. 지형 그리는거는 이걸 기준으로 하자. 이 방법을 스킬화해놔. 그리고 나머지 4막 전체에 대해 횡전개해봐”
+
+Accepted: raster concept → flatter vector-style raster → native Inkscape trace → bounded optimization → visual comparison. Approval is not game validation.
+
+Archive: HONRO_ACT4_VECTOR_PILOT_32_35_37.zip
+Library: libfile_ca222e80464881918f7ee7eaa730eb31
+SHA256: 0e2f6401c9d53ba5777efb1b90092afbd571c24ddbbcd60eeff503a24518ec07
+
+1536×1024 sources. Stage32: 24 colors, 1,395,095 bytes, 66,667→47,014 segments. Stage35: 16 colors, 1,316,451 bytes, 71,222→44,458. Stage37: 24 colors, 2,142,513 bytes, 108,416→71,606. These observations are not universal quotas.
+
+Known limits: window bars, bamboo rings, box planks partly merged during tracing; some shrubs mapped to blue. Whole-scene color compounds are not semantic assets. Major stairs/eaves/braces/bridge connections were visually preserved during optimization. Collision, routes, performance and tide gameplay were not tested.
